#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-SEND-0111 expect=violation domain=DM
#note "PROPOSED-RULE scenario (ruling 8). BRTHDTC declared with def:Origin Type=Derived - the sheet's explicit prohibition ('BRTHDTC should never be derived'). Proposed rule fires (Derived is not Collected). CURRENT rule tests only emptiness of the origin, and Derived is non-empty -> predicted-red: engine reports noViolation where this scenario expects 1 violation on variable_name=BRTHDTC."
#library standard=sendig version=3-1-1
#define-xml CDISC-SEND-0111-derived-define.xml
#expectViolationCount 1
#expectViolationAt variable_name=BRTHDTC
dataset DM
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col BRTHDTC type=Char
---
S1 | S1-001 | 2020-01-01
